ChemSpecAI
Business Need
1.	Document Complexity & Volume: Managing large, complex TDS and SDS documents manually leads to inconsistencies and high operational risk.
2.	Delayed Information Access: Slow access to accurate product and safety data delays customer and regulatory responses.
3.	Reactive Risk Management: Compliance and safety risks are detected reactively instead of proactively.
4.	Unstructured Requirements Handling: Requirements scattered in unstructured sources lack visibility and traceability.
5.	Manual Analysis & Delivery Risk: Manual documentation and analysis drive delays and increase delivery risk.
Solution
Streamlit UI – 3 tabbed interface (includes Upload, Chat, Dashboard).
LangGraph orchestration pipeline – four node agentic graph with conditional edges and a 5 iteration cap.
GPT-4o mini via Azure OpenAI – classifies SDS vs TDS, generates grounded answers, and drives agentic tool calling at temperature 0.0
OData enforced document routing and SHA-256 deduplication – type filtering at the search layer, deterministic chunk IDs prevent index bloat on re upload
Ticktoken chunking and text-embedding-3-small – 500 token context windows embedded into 1536 dim vectors, stored in Azure AI Search HNSW index.
3-layer Responsible AI – system prompt refusal, Azure Content filter, agent level exception handler, these are the harmful queries refused gracefully, never crashed

Benefits
<>  Faster TDS & SDS Intelligence Access
<> Improved Data Accuracy & Consistency
<> Operational Efficiency at Scale  
<> Reliable, Auditable AI Responses
<>  Enterprise Grade Responsible AI
<> Scalable & Future Ready Architecture
